---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '~/components/Hero.astro';
import Section from '~/components/Section.astro';
import CTA from '~/components/CTA.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="NitroX Consulting — a French, EU-based consultancy founded in 2001, now focused on AI systems, built on thirty-five years of high-stakes engineering."
  lang="en"
  path="/about"
>
  <Hero
    tagline="About"
    title="A small team that ships."
    subtitle="Founded in 2001 in the south of France. We started in capital-markets risk and pricing; today we build and run AI systems on that same foundation."
  />

  <Section tagline="Who builds it" title="Olivier Moreau, founder">
    <div class="grid max-w-4xl gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:items-start">
      <img
        src="/images/olivier-moreau.jpg"
        alt="Olivier Moreau, founder of NitroX Consulting"
        width="308"
        height="451"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        class="w-40 rounded-xl border border-token md:w-full"
      />
      <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <p>
          <strong>École Polytechnique (X 88)</strong> — France's foremost engineering grande école. Thirty-five
          years across finance, software and running a business — three trades rarely found in the same person.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Finance.</strong> Ten years on the trading floors of Paribas and Commerzbank in Paris and
          London: commodity and energy options, then FX, then head of the swaps desk and the CDS desk. Then chief
          risk officer of an investment fund in London. Systems where a mistake shows up the same day, in real
          money.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Software.</strong> I have always built the tools as well as used them: a C++ financial library,
          a trading platform, then CTO of two financial platforms — bank asset-liability management, then tax-risk
          assessment. C++, C#, Java, Python, SQL, cloud. I still write code today.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Business.</strong> I founded NitroX Consulting in 2001. We work for banks, investment funds and
          insurers — modelling, risk audit, regulatory implementation. I have taught finance and risk at EDHEC and
          SKEMA since 2018, and at First Finance since 2010.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today I design and operate AI systems — starting with <strong>NitroxBrain</strong>, our own assistant,
          in daily use. When you hand us a project, you talk to the person who builds it.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/olivier-moreau-8948b97/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
            LinkedIn profile
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="From trading desks to AI in production">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
      <p>
        NitroX Consulting was founded in 2001 to solve hard, practical problems for capital-markets clients — pricing exotic and
        optional products, managing risk on live books, and building the software that made it possible.
      </p>
      <p>
        Risk management, we learned, is earned in crisis situations. That instinct — for what can go wrong, and for building systems
        that are correct and auditable — is exactly what most technology projects are missing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today our focus is <strong>AI</strong>. We design, build and operate agentic AI systems, automation and knowledge tools —
        most visibly <strong>NitroxBrain</strong>, our own production AI assistant. We bring thirty-five years of high-stakes engineering
        rigour to a field that badly needs it.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are deliberately small, EU-based, and data-resident by default. You work directly with the people who build your system —
        no account layer, no offshore hand-off.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section surface title="How we work">
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-token bg-surface p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Direct</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">You talk to the engineers doing the work, start to finish.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-token bg-surface p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Honest scoping</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">If AI or a custom build is the wrong answer, we tell you before you spend.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-token bg-surface p-6">
        <h3 class="font-semibold">EU-first</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Data residency and GDPR are defaults, not add-ons.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <CTA
    title="Let's build something that works."
    actions={[{ label: 'Contact us', href: '/contact', variant: 'primary' }]}
  />
</Layout>
